title Service mesh
direction right

Mobile app [icon: mobile]
Web app [icon: react]
Partners [icon: building]

Edge [color: gray] {
  API gateway [icon: kong]
  Auth [icon: auth0]
}
Mesh [icon: istio, color: blue] {
  Users svc [icon: server]
  Profiles svc [icon: server]
  Feed svc [icon: server]
  Posts svc [icon: server]
  Media svc [icon: server]
  Notifications svc [icon: server]
  Search svc [icon: server]
  Recommendations svc [icon: brain]
}
Datastores [color: purple] {
  Users DB [icon: postgres, shape: cylinder]
  Posts DB [icon: mongodb, shape: cylinder]
  Graph DB [icon: neo4j, shape: cylinder]
  Search index [icon: elasticsearch]
  Media store [icon: bucket]
  Cache [icon: redis]
}
Message bus [icon: kafka, color: orange]
Push providers [icon: notification]

Mobile app, Web app, Partners > API gateway
API gateway <> Auth
API gateway > Users svc, Feed svc, Posts svc, Search svc
Users svc <> Profiles svc
Feed svc > Posts svc, Recommendations svc
Posts svc > Media svc
Users svc, Profiles svc > Users DB
Posts svc > Posts DB
Recommendations svc > Graph DB
Search svc > Search index
Media svc > Media store
Feed svc, Users svc > Cache
Posts svc --> Message bus: PostCreated
Message bus --> Notifications svc, Search svc, Recommendations svc
Notifications svc > Push providers
